OL,3,AHousehold energy bills to hit
OL,4,Athree-year high as Ofgem announces 4%
OL,5,Arise from October
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government said its cut to VAT on
OL,8,Felectricity bills will save households
OL,9,F#45 and it was doing more to address
OL,10,Fcost of living pressures, but
OL,11,Fopposition parties said Labour was not
OL,12,Fdoing enough.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
