OL,3,ANHS failing child sexual abuse victims
OL,4,Ain adulthood, say psychiatrists
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople sexually abused as children who
OL,7,Fseek help in later life for mental
OL,8,Fhealth problems are being failed by the
OL,9,FNHS, senior doctors have told the BBC.
OL,11,FThe Royal College of Psychiatrists is
OL,12,Fissuing a public apology for what it
OL,13,Fsays is decades of mismanagement and
OL,14,Fmisdiagnosis in the UK.
OL,16,FFor some, it has worsened their
OL,17,Ftraumas, it said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
