OL,3,ADad of woman who took her own life says
OL,4,ATreasury failed in its duty of care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a civil service employee
OL,7,Fwho took her own life the day after a
OL,8,Fmeeting with her managers has said the
OL,9,Flack of support given to her by the
OL,10,FTreasury "beggars belief".
OL,12,FChloe Moffat, 26, a personal assistant
OL,13,Fto a Treasury director, died on 20 May
OL,14,Flast year, after she was told of
OL,15,Fallegations she had shared sensitive
OL,16,Fconfidential information about
OL,17,Fcolleagues, which she denied.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
