OL,3,ADad of woman who took her own life says
OL,4,ATreasury failed in its duty of care
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,7,Fprogramme, David Moffat said he did not
OL,8,Ffeel the Treasury had taken
OL,9,Fresponsibility for its part in her
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,FHe added that her loss was
OL,13,F"devastating", and had "torn such a big
OL,14,Fhole in our lives".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
