OL,3,APakistani PM suspends top health
OL,4,Aofficial after 14 newborn babies killed
OL,5,Ain hospital fire
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation into the fire is under
OL,8,Fway, with a committee ordered to report
OL,9,Fwithin 24 hours
OL,11,FThe father of a victim has criticised
OL,12,Fthe safety measures in place at the
OL,13,Fhospital, saying only one door was open
OL,14,Ffor visitors
OL,16,FThe hospital's executive director tells
OL,17,Fthe BBC the door to the maternity ward
OL,18,Fwas not locked, but it was manned
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
