OL,3,ACanada announces 'dollar-for-dollar'
OL,4,Aretaliatory tariffs on US as high as
OL,5,A50%
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanada has announced counter-tariffs as
OL,8,Fhigh as 50% on a range of US goods in
OL,9,Fretaliation to the latest wave of
OL,10,Flevies on Canadian imports imposed by
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump last weekend.
OL,13,FThe Canadian tariffs will apply to
OL,14,Fnearly C$28bn ($20bn; #15bn) worth of
OL,15,FAmerican products, ranging from steel
OL,16,Fto furniture, fresh tuna and cotton
OL,17,FT-shirts, officials announced on
OL,18,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
