OL,3,ACanada announces 'dollar-for-dollar'
OL,4,Aretaliatory tariffs on US as high as
OL,5,A50%
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe list of targeted products is
OL,8,Fdesigned to match Canadian goods hit by
OL,9,Fthe US. The Canadian levies are set to
OL,10,Fcome into effect on 8 September.
OL,12,FIt is the latest escalation after
OL,13,FUS-Canada trade talks collapsed late
OL,14,Flast week, with each side accusing the
OL,15,Fother of making last-minute demands
OL,16,Fthat were unreasonable.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
